>
<p data-start=3D"631" data-end=3D"922" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99histoire de Jav=
a remonte aux ann=C3=A9es 1990. Le langage a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 d=C3=A9velopp=C3=
=A9 par <strong data-start=3D"706" data-end=3D"723">James Gosling</strong> =
