<h4 data-start=3D"796" data-end=3D"827" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"80=
1" data-end=3D"827">Qu'est-ce que le JDK ?</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"829" data-end=3D"949" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=3D"=
832" data-end=3D"862">JDK (Java Development Kit)</strong> est un ensemble d=
'outils n=C3=A9cessaire pour d=C3=A9velopper des applications Java. Il incl=
ut :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"950" data-end=3D"1214">
<li data-start=3D"950" data-end=3D"1035" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"952" data-end=3D"1035" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=3D=
"955" data-end=3D"989">JRE (Java Runtime Environment)</strong>, qui permet =
d'ex=C3=A9cuter des applications Java.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1036" data-end=3D"1131" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1038" data-end=3D"1131" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"1041" data-end=3D"1069">compilateur Java (javac)</strong>, qui converti=
t votre code source Java en bytecode ex=C3=A9cutable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1132" data-end=3D"1214" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1134" data-end=3D"1214" class=3D"">Des outils de d=C3=A9bo=
gage, des biblioth=C3=A8ques Java standard et d'autres utilitaires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1216" data-end=3D"1379" class=3D"">Le JDK est r=C3=A9guli=
=C3=A8rement mis =C3=A0 jour par Oracle, et il existe plusieurs versions di=
sponibles : <strong data-start=3D"1310" data-end=3D"1319">JDK 8</strong>, <=
strong data-start=3D"1321" data-end=3D"1331">JDK 11</strong>, <strong data-=
start=3D"1333" data-end=3D"1343">JDK 17</strong>, et les derni=C3=A8res ver=
sions en date.</p>
