<li data-start=3D"5265" data-end=3D"5398" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5267" data-end=3D"5398" class=3D"">Entrez <code data-start=
=3D"5274" data-end=3D"5285">JAVA_HOME</code> comme nom de la variable et le=
 chemin d'installation de votre JDK (par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5366"=
 data-end=3D"5396">C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-17</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5400" data-end=3D"5638" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5403" data-end=3D"5439" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
403" data-end=3D"5439">Mettre =C3=A0 jour la variable PATH :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5443" data-end=3D"5638">
<li data-start=3D"5443" data-end=3D"5532" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5445" data-end=3D"5532" class=3D"">Recherchez la variable =
<strong data-start=3D"5468" data-end=3D"5476">Path</strong> dans les variab=
les syst=C3=A8me et cliquez sur <strong data-start=3D"5519" data-end=3D"553=
1">Modifier</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5536" data-end=3D"5638" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5538" data-end=3D"5638" class=3D"">Ajoutez un nouvel =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9ment dans la liste avec le chemin suivant : <code data-start=3D"5=
603" data-end=3D"5637">C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-17\bin</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5640" data-end=3D"5796" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5643" data-end=3D"5661" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
643" data-end=3D"5661">V=C3=A9rification :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5665" data-end=3D"5796">
<li data-start=3D"5665" data-end=3D"5796" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5667" data-end=3D"5796" class=3D"">Ouvrez un nouveau termi=
nal (cmd) et tapez <code data-start=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5724">java -versio=
n</code> et <code data-start=3D"5728" data-end=3D"5744">javac -version</cod=
e> pour vous assurer que tout fonctionne correctement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
