ct=C3=A8res peut =C3=AAtre cr=C3=A9=C3=A9e de deux mani=C3=A8res :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3131" data-end=3D"3260">
<li data-start=3D"3131" data-end=3D"3205" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3134" data-end=3D"3205" class=3D"">En utilisant des guille=
