<p data-start=3D"4551" data-end=3D"4568" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
551" data-end=3D"4566">Explication</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4569" data-end=3D"4748">
<li data-start=3D"4569" data-end=3D"4748" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4571" data-end=3D"4748" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode <code d=
ata-start=3D"4582" data-end=3D"4592">concat()</code> ajoute une cha=C3=AEne=
 au texte existant, mais ne modifie pas la cha=C3=AEne <code data-start=3D"=
4660" data-end=3D"4667">texte</code> originale. Au lieu de cela, une nouvel=
le cha=C3=AEne est cr=C3=A9=C3=A9e et assign=C3=A9e =C3=A0 <code data-start=
=3D"4740" data-end=3D"4747">texte</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"4750" data-end=3D"4804" class=3D"">Quelques m=C3=A9thodes=
 courantes de la classe <code data-start=3D"4796" data-end=3D"4804">String<=
/code></h4>
<p data-start=3D"4806" data-end=3D"4956" class=3D"">La classe <code data-st=
art=3D"4816" data-end=3D"4824">String</code> offre de nombreuses m=C3=A9tho=
des utiles pour manipuler les cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8res. Voici quelqu=
es-unes des m=C3=A9thodes les plus courantes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4958" data-end=3D"5273">
<li data-start=3D"4958" data-end=3D"5011" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4960" data-end=3D"5011" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
960" data-end=3D"4974"><code data-start=3D"4962" data-end=3D"4972">length()=
</code></strong> : Retourne la longueur de la cha=C3=AEne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5012" data-end=3D"5075" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5014" data-end=3D"5075" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
014" data-end=3D"5028"><code data-start=3D"5016" data-end=3D"5026">charAt()=
</code></strong> : Retourne le caract=C3=A8re =C3=A0 une position donn=C3=
=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5076" data-end=3D"5122" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5078" data-end=3D"5122" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
078" data-end=3D"5095"><code data-start=3D"5080" data-end=3D"5093">substrin=
g()</code></strong> : Extrait une sous-cha=C3=AEne.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5123" data-end=3D"5181" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5125" data-end=3D"5181" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
125" data-end=3D"5139"><code data-start=3D"5127" data-end=3D"5137">equals()=
</code></strong> : Compare deux cha=C3=AEnes pour leur =C3=A9galit=C3=A9.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5182" data-end=3D"5273" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5184" data-end=3D"5273" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
184" data-end=3D"5222"><code data-start=3D"5186" data-end=3D"5201">toUpperC=
ase()</code> et <code data-start=3D"5205" data-end=3D"5220">toLowerCase()</=
code></strong> : Convertit la cha=C3=AEne en majuscules ou minuscules.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5275" data-end=3D"5284" class=3D"">Exemple :</p>
