<li data-start=3D"6670" data-end=3D"6791" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6672" data-end=3D"6791" class=3D"">Le bloc <code data-star=
t=3D"6680" data-end=3D"6685">try</code> contient une instruction <code data=
-start=3D"6711" data-end=3D"6719">return</code>, ce qui signifie que la m=
=C3=A9thode va normalement retourner la valeur <code data-start=3D"6787" da=
ta-end=3D"6790">1</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6792" data-end=3D"7021" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6794" data-end=3D"7021" class=3D"">Cependant, le bloc <cod=
e data-start=3D"6813" data-end=3D"6822">finally</code> est toujours ex=C3=
=A9cut=C3=A9 avant le retour de la m=C3=A9thode, et il est important de not=
er que si <code data-start=3D"6911" data-end=3D"6920">finally</code> contie=
nt une instruction <code data-start=3D"6946" data-end=3D"6954">return</code=
>, elle remplacera la valeur retourn=C3=A9e par le bloc <code data-start=3D=
"7004" data-end=3D"7009">try</code> ou <code data-start=3D"7013" data-end=
=3D"7020">catch</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7023" data-end=3D"7070" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
