3>
<h4 data-start=3D"7072" data-end=3D"7115" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7077" data-end=3D"7113">Gestion des exceptions multiples</strong> :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"7116" data-end=3D"7485">
<li data-start=3D"7116" data-end=3D"7315" class=3D"">
