usieurs blocs <code data-start=3D"7155" data-end=3D"7162">catch</code> pour=
 g=C3=A9rer diff=C3=A9rentes exceptions. Cependant, il est g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ra=
lement pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rable de capturer des exceptions plus g=C3=A9n=C3=A9r=
ales apr=C3=A8s des exceptions sp=C3=A9cifiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7316" data-end=3D"7485" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7318" data-end=3D"7485" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
