<h4 data-start=3D"3682" data-end=3D"3704" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3687" data-end=3D"3704">Explication :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3988">
<li data-start=3D"3705" data-end=3D"3794" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3707" data-end=3D"3794" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode <code d=
ata-start=3D"3718" data-end=3D"3730">methodeA()</code> capture l'exception =
<code data-start=3D"3751" data-end=3D"3772">ArithmeticException</code> dans=
 un bloc <code data-start=3D"3786" data-end=3D"3793">catch</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3795" data-end=3D"3988" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3797" data-end=3D"3988" class=3D"">Ensuite, au lieu de tra=
iter l'exception, elle la relance avec l'instruction <code data-start=3D"38=
73" data-end=3D"3882">throw e</code>, ce qui entra=C3=AEne la propagation d=
e l'exception vers la m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=3D"3946" data-end=3D"39=
54">main()</code>, o=C3=B9 elle est finalement captur=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3990" data-end=3D"4052" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3994" data-end=3D"4052">4. La d=C3=A9claration des exceptions =C3=A0 propag=
er : <code data-start=3D"4042" data-end=3D"4050">throws</code></strong></h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"4054" data-end=3D"4295" class=3D"">Lorsqu'une m=C3=A9thode=
