ode, car il s'agit d'une exception non v=C3=A9rifi=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7688" data-end=3D"7766" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7690" data-end=3D"7766" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode <code d=
ata-start=3D"7701" data-end=3D"7709">main()</code> capture cette exception =
