end=3D"2432">couleur</code>, <code data-start=3D"2434" data-end=3D"2442">ma=
rque</code>, <code data-start=3D"2444" data-end=3D"2456">vitesseMax</code>)=
 et deux m=C3=A9thodes (<code data-start=3D"2476" data-end=3D"2488">demarre=
r()</code>, <code data-start=3D"2490" data-end=3D"2503">accelerer()</code>)=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2506" data-end=3D"2647" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2508" data-end=3D"2647" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"2512" data-end=3D"2522">classe</strong> est simplement une <strong data=
-start=3D"2542" data-end=3D"2556">d=C3=A9finition</strong> d'objets, sans r=
