<h2 data-start=3D"3017" data-end=3D"3058" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3020" data-end=3D"3056">3. Utilisation des Constructeurs</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3060" data-end=3D"3104" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3064" data-end=3D"3102">3.1 Qu'est-ce qu'un constructeur ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3105" data-end=3D"3222" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"3108" data-end=3D"3124">constructeur</strong> est une m=C3=A9thode sp=
=C3=A9ciale utilis=C3=A9e pour initialiser un objet <strong data-start=3D"3=
185" data-end=3D"3219">au moment de son instanciation</strong>.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3224" data-end=3D"3269" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3229" data-end=3D"3269">Caract=C3=A9ristiques d'un constructeur :</strong><=
/h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3270" data-end=3D"3450">
<li data-start=3D"3270" data-end=3D"3313" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3272" data-end=3D"3313" class=3D"">Il <strong data-start=
=3D"3275" data-end=3D"3310">porte le m=C3=AAme nom que la classe</strong>.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3314" data-end=3D"3369" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3316" data-end=3D"3369" class=3D"">Il <strong data-start=
=3D"3319" data-end=3D"3348">ne retourne pas de valeur</strong> (m=C3=AAme p=
as <code data-start=3D"3359" data-end=3D"3365">void</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3370" data-end=3D"3450" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3372" data-end=3D"3450" class=3D"">Il est <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"3379" data-end=3D"3436">appel=C3=A9 automatiquement lors de la cr=C3=
=A9ation de l=E2=80=99objet</strong> avec <code data-start=3D"3442" data-en=
d=3D"3447">new</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
