<hr data-start=3D"3973" data-end=3D"3976" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3978" data-end=3D"4029" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3981" data-end=3D"4029">3. Surcharge de M=C3=A9thode (Method Overloading)</=
strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4031" data-end=3D"4277" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"4034" data-end=3D"4058">surcharge de m=C3=A9thode</strong> permet de d=
=C3=A9finir plusieurs m=C3=A9thodes avec le m=C3=AAme nom dans une <strong =
data-start=3D"4122" data-end=3D"4137">m=C3=AAme classe</strong>, mais avec =
des signatures diff=C3=A9rentes. Cela permet =C3=A0 une m=C3=A9thode de tra=
iter diff=C3=A9rents types ou nombres de param=C3=A8tres sans changer son n=
om.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4325" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4283" data-end=3D"4325">3.1 Syntaxe de la Surcharge de M=C3=A9thode</strong=
></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4327" data-end=3D"4515" class=3D"">La surcharge de m=C3=A9=
thode se fait en <strong data-start=3D"4362" data-end=3D"4390">modifiant le=
s param=C3=A8tres</strong> : soit en modifiant le <strong data-start=3D"441=
4" data-end=3D"4424">nombre</strong> des param=C3=A8tres, soit leur <strong=
 data-start=3D"4451" data-end=3D"4459">type</strong>. Le type ou l=E2=80=99=
ordre des param=C3=A8tres doit =C3=AAtre diff=C3=A9rent.</p>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"4517" data-end=3D"5194"><div=
 class=3D"contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border=
