<h3 data-start=3D"5361" data-end=3D"5406" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5365" data-end=3D"5406">3.2 R=C3=A8gles de la Surcharge de M=C3=A9thode</st=
rong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"5407" data-end=3D"5894">
<li data-start=3D"5407" data-end=3D"5541" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5410" data-end=3D"5541" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
410" data-end=3D"5427">Nom identique</strong> : La m=C3=A9thode doit avoir =
le m=C3=AAme nom, mais des signatures diff=C3=A9rentes (diff=C3=A9rents typ=
es ou nombres de param=C3=A8tres).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5542" data-end=3D"5742" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5545" data-end=3D"5742" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
545" data-end=3D"5598">Pas de modification de la signature de la m=C3=A9tho=
de</strong> : On ne peut pas seulement changer le type de retour de la m=C3=
=A9thode pour la surcharger (la signature de la m=C3=A9thode doit inclure l=
es param=C3=A8tres).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5743" data-end=3D"5894" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5746" data-end=3D"5894" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
746" data-end=3D"5788">Ex=C3=A9cution de la m=C3=A9thode correspondante</st=
rong> : En fonction des arguments pass=C3=A9s lors de l'appel de la m=C3=A9=
thode, Java s=C3=A9lectionne la m=C3=A9thode appropri=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ol>
