<li data-start=3D"9108" data-end=3D"9211" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"9110" data-end=3D"9211" class=3D"">Vous voulez utiliser le=
 <strong data-start=3D"9134" data-end=3D"9151">polymorphisme</strong> pour =
traiter diff=C3=A9rents types d'objets de mani=C3=A8re uniforme.</p>
