interface <code data-start=3D"2160" data-end=3D"2170">Iterable</code> et d=
=C3=A9finit des m=C3=A9thodes pour ajouter, supprimer, tester l'appartenanc=
e d=E2=80=99=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments, etc.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2261" data-end=3D"2303" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
261" data-end=3D"2303">M=C3=A9thodes courantes dans <code data-start=3D"228=
7" data-end=3D"2299">Collection</code> :</strong></p>
