<h3 data-start=3D"2397" data-end=3D"2441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2401" data-end=3D"2441">1.3 Applications courantes des piles</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2442" data-end=3D"2502" class=3D"">Les piles sont utilis=
=C3=A9es dans diverses applications, comme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2504" data-end=3D"2838">
<li data-start=3D"2504" data-end=3D"2620" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2506" data-end=3D"2620" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
506" data-end=3D"2540">Annulation/Refaire des actions</strong> : Les piles =
permettent de revenir =C3=A0 un =C3=A9tat pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dent en empilant c=
haque =C3=A9tape.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2621" data-end=3D"2714" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2623" data-end=3D"2714" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
623" data-end=3D"2657">Parcours d=E2=80=99arbre et de graphes</strong> : Ut=
ilis=C3=A9es pour effectuer des travers=C3=A9es en profondeur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2715" data-end=3D"2838" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2717" data-end=3D"2838" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
717" data-end=3D"2745">=C3=89valuation d'expressions</strong> : Comme les e=
xpressions arithm=C3=A9tiques et les parenth=C3=A8ses dans les langages de =
programmation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2840" data-end=3D"2843" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2845" data-end=3D"2886" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2848" data-end=3D"2886">2. Qu'est-ce qu'une File (Queue) ?</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2888" data-end=3D"2931" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2892" data-end=3D"2931">2.1 D=C3=A9finitions et caract=C3=A9ristiques</stro=
ng></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2933" data-end=3D"3223" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"2937" data-end=3D"2945">file</strong> (ou <code data-start=3D"2950" dat=
a-end=3D"2957">Queue</code> en anglais) est une structure de donn=C3=A9es q=
ui fonctionne selon le principe <strong data-start=3D"3032" data-end=3D"304=
0">FIFO</strong> ("First In, First Out"). Cela signifie que l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9=
ment qui est ajout=C3=A9 en premier dans la file sera le premier =C3=A0 en =
=C3=AAtre retir=C3=A9, semblable =C3=A0 une file d'attente =C3=A0 la caisse=
 d'un magasin.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3225" data-end=3D"3263" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3230" data-end=3D"3263">2.1.1 Op=C3=A9rations sur une file</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3265" data-end=3D"3329" class=3D"">Les principales op=C3=
=A9rations que l=E2=80=99on effectue sur une file sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3331" data-end=3D"3548">
<li data-start=3D"3331" data-end=3D"3386" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3333" data-end=3D"3386" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
333" data-end=3D"3344">Enqueue</strong> : Ajouter un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment =C3=
=A0 la fin de la file.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3387" data-end=3D"3441" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3389" data-end=3D"3441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
389" data-end=3D"3400">Dequeue</strong> : Retirer l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment au d=
=C3=A9but de la file.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3442" data-end=3D"3500" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3444" data-end=3D"3500" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
444" data-end=3D"3452">Peek</strong> : Acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9m=
ent au d=C3=A9but sans le retirer.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3501" data-end=3D"3548" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3503" data-end=3D"3548" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
503" data-end=3D"3516">isEmpty()</strong> : V=C3=A9rifier si la file est vi=
de.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3550" data-end=3D"3595" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3554" data-end=3D"3595">2.2 Impl=C3=A9mentation d'une file en Java</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3597" data-end=3D"3833" class=3D"">Java offre l'interface =
<code data-start=3D"3620" data-end=3D"3627">Queue</code> et la classe <code=
 data-start=3D"3641" data-end=3D"3653">LinkedList</code> pour impl=C3=A9men=
ter une file. Bien que la classe <code data-start=3D"3700" data-end=3D"3712=
">LinkedList</code> soit la plus couramment utilis=C3=A9e, Java propose =C3=
=A9galement d'autres impl=C3=A9mentations comme <code data-start=3D"3801" d=
ata-end=3D"3816">PriorityQueue</code> et <code data-start=3D"3820" data-end=
=3D"3832">ArrayDeque</code>.</p>
