<hr data-start=3D"6413" data-end=3D"6416" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6467" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6421" data-end=3D"6467">5. Avantages et inconv=C3=A9nients de <code data-st=
art=3D"6456" data-end=3D"6465">HashMap</code></strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6469" data-end=3D"6490" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6473" data-end=3D"6490">5.1 Avantages</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6491" data-end=3D"6635">
<li data-start=3D"6491" data-end=3D"6534" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6493" data-end=3D"6534" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
493" data-end=3D"6509">Acc=C3=A8s rapide</strong> =C3=A0 un =C3=A9l=C3=A9me=
nt par sa cl=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6535" data-end=3D"6585" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6537" data-end=3D"6585" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
537" data-end=3D"6584">Manipulation efficace des paires cl=C3=A9-valeur</st=
rong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6586" data-end=3D"6635" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6588" data-end=3D"6635" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
588" data-end=3D"6634">Prise en charge des cl=C3=A9s et valeurs <code data-=
start=3D"6626" data-end=3D"6632">null</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6637" data-end=3D"6662" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6641" data-end=3D"6662">5.2 Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6663" data-end=3D"6892">
<li data-start=3D"6663" data-end=3D"6748" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6665" data-end=3D"6748" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
665" data-end=3D"6688">Pas d'ordre garanti</strong> : L'ordre des =C3=A9l=
=C3=A9ments dans un <code data-start=3D"6720" data-end=3D"6729">HashMap</co=
de> n'est pas garanti.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6749" data-end=3D"6892" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6751" data-end=3D"6892" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
751" data-end=3D"6777">Gestion des collisions</strong> : Bien que la gestio=
n des collisions soit efficace, elle peut r=C3=A9duire les performances dan=
s certains cas extr=C3=AAmes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6894" data-end=3D"6897" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6899" data-end=3D"6944" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6902" data-end=3D"6944">6. Applications courantes de <code data-start=3D"69=
33" data-end=3D"6942">HashMap</code></strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"6946" data-end=3D"7031" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"6950" data-end=3D"6971">tables de hachage</strong> sont utilis=C3=A9es =
dans de nombreuses applications, notamment :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7032" data-end=3D"7262">
<li data-start=3D"7032" data-end=3D"7077" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7034" data-end=3D"7077" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
034" data-end=3D"7044">Caches</strong> : Le stockage rapide d'=C3=A9l=C3=A9=
ments.</p>
