de modifier la variable <code data-start=3D"3788" data-end=3D"3798">compteu=
r</code> simultan=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3814" data-end=3D"3933" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3816" data-end=3D"3933" class=3D"">La m=C3=A9thode <code d=
