<p data-start=3D"4439" data-end=3D"4456" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
439" data-end=3D"4454">Explication</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4457" data-end=3D"4622">
<li data-start=3D"4457" data-end=3D"4622" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4459" data-end=3D"4622" class=3D"">Le bloc <code data-star=
t=3D"4467" data-end=3D"4488">synchronized (this)</code> synchronise uniquem=
ent la section de code o=C3=B9 <code data-start=3D"4534" data-end=3D"4544">=
compteur</code> est modifi=C3=A9, ce qui r=C3=A9duit les performances impac=
t=C3=A9es par la synchronisation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
