<p data-start=3D"4518" data-end=3D"4535" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
518" data-end=3D"4533">Explication</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4536" data-end=3D"4735">
<li data-start=3D"4536" data-end=3D"4735" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4538" data-end=3D"4735" class=3D"">Nous avons d=C3=A9fini =
une t=C3=A2che <code data-start=3D"4566" data-end=3D"4576">Callable</code> =
qui renvoie un entier. La m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=3D"4611" data-end=
=3D"4621">submit()</code> soumet la t=C3=A2che au pool de threads et renvoi=
e un objet <code data-start=3D"4677" data-end=3D"4685">Future</code> qui pe=
rmettra de r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer le r=C3=A9sultat plus tard.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4737" data-end=3D"4771" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4741" data-end=3D"4771">2.2 Qu'est-ce que Future ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4773" data-end=3D"4957" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"477=
3" data-end=3D"4781">Future</code> est une interface qui repr=C3=A9sente le=
 r=C3=A9sultat d'une t=C3=A2che asynchrone. Elle permet de r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9=
rer le r=C3=A9sultat d'une t=C3=A2che apr=C3=A8s son ex=C3=A9cution et de g=
=C3=A9rer les exceptions possibles.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4959" data-end=3D"5014" class=3D"">Les principales m=C3=A9=
thodes de l'interface <code data-start=3D"4999" data-end=3D"5007">Future</c=
ode> sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5016" data-end=3D"5379">
<li data-start=3D"5016" data-end=3D"5180" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5018" data-end=3D"5180" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
018" data-end=3D"5029"><code data-start=3D"5020" data-end=3D"5027">get()</c=
ode></strong> : R=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re le r=C3=A9sultat de la t=C3=A2che, bloqu=
ant l'ex=C3=A9cution jusqu'=C3=A0 ce que la t=C3=A2che soit termin=C3=A9e. =
Si la t=C3=A2che =C3=A9choue, cette m=C3=A9thode lance une exception.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5181" data-end=3D"5235" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5183" data-end=3D"5235" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
183" data-end=3D"5197"><code data-start=3D"5185" data-end=3D"5195">isDone()=
</code></strong> : V=C3=A9rifie si la t=C3=A2che a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 ex=C3=A9cu=
t=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5236" data-end=3D"5320" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5238" data-end=3D"5320" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
