532" data-end=3D"8549"><code data-start=3D"8534" data-end=3D"8547">invokeAl=
l()</code></strong> : Ex=C3=A9cute un ensemble de t=C3=A2ches et retourne u=
ne liste de <code data-start=3D"8607" data-end=3D"8615">Future</code> lorsq=
ue toutes les t=C3=A2ches sont termin=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8658" data-end=3D"8764" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8660" data-end=3D"8764" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
660" data-end=3D"8677"><code data-start=3D"8662" data-end=3D"8675">invokeAn=
y()</code></strong> : Ex=C3=A9cute un ensemble de t=C3=A2ches et retourne l=
e r=C3=A9sultat de la premi=C3=A8re t=C3=A2che termin=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
