<h2 data-start=3D"4766" data-end=3D"4792" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4769" data-end=3D"4792">2. Optional en Java</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"4794" data-end=3D"5108" class=3D"">La classe <strong data-=
start=3D"4804" data-end=3D"4816">Optional</strong> en Java est utilis=C3=A9=
e pour repr=C3=A9senter des valeurs qui peuvent =C3=AAtre pr=C3=A9sentes ou=
 absentes, tout en =C3=A9vitant les erreurs li=C3=A9es =C3=A0 des r=C3=A9f=
=C3=A9rences nulles. Elle permet de traiter de mani=C3=A8re plus =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9gante les cas o=C3=B9 une valeur peut =C3=AAtre <code data-start=3D"5046=
" data-end=3D"5052">null</code> sans risquer de rencontrer un <strong data-=
start=3D"5083" data-end=3D"5107">NullPointerException</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5110" data-end=3D"5150" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5114" data-end=3D"5150">2.1 Cr=C3=A9ation d'un Objet Optional</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5152" data-end=3D"5251" class=3D"">Vous pouvez cr=C3=A9er =
un objet <code data-start=3D"5179" data-end=3D"5189">Optional</code> en uti=
lisant les m=C3=A9thodes statiques de la classe <code data-start=3D"5239" d=
ata-end=3D"5249">Optional</code> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5253" data-end=3D"5501">
<li data-start=3D"5253" data-end=3D"5330" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5255" data-end=3D"5330" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"525=
5" data-end=3D"5277">Optional.of(T value)</code> : Cr=C3=A9e un <code data-=
start=3D"5288" data-end=3D"5298">Optional</code> contenant une valeur non n=
ulle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5331" data-end=3D"5420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5333" data-end=3D"5420" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"533=
3" data-end=3D"5363">Optional.ofNullable(T value)</code> : Cr=C3=A9e un <co=
de data-start=3D"5374" data-end=3D"5384">Optional</code> qui peut contenir =
une valeur nulle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5421" data-end=3D"5501" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5423" data-end=3D"5501" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"542=
3" data-end=3D"5441">Optional.empty()</code> : Cr=C3=A9e un <code data-star=
t=3D"5452" data-end=3D"5462">Optional</code> vide, repr=C3=A9sentant une va=
leur absente.</p>
</li>
</ul>
