<h2 data-start=3D"5910" data-end=3D"5954" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5913" data-end=3D"5952">5. Limites et consid=C3=A9rations du SRP</strong></=
h2>
<p data-start=3D"5956" data-end=3D"6091" class=3D"">Bien que le SRP soit un=
 principe puissant, il peut aussi entra=C3=AEner <strong data-start=3D"6023=
" data-end=3D"6055">une prolif=C3=A9ration de classes</strong> si appliqu=
=C3=A9 de mani=C3=A8re excessive.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6093" data-end=3D"6139" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6097" data-end=3D"6137">5.1 Quand faut-il appliquer le SRP ?</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6140" data-end=3D"6337">
<li data-start=3D"6140" data-end=3D"6224" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6142" data-end=3D"6224" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
142" data-end=3D"6181">Si une classe devient trop complexe</strong> (plusie=
urs centaines de lignes de code).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6225" data-end=3D"6292" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6227" data-end=3D"6292" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
227" data-end=3D"6289">Si une classe change trop souvent pour diff=C3=A9ren=
tes raisons</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6293" data-end=3D"6337" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6295" data-end=3D"6337" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
295" data-end=3D"6334">Si la maintenance devient difficile</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6339" data-end=3D"6381" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6343" data-end=3D"6379">5.2 Quand ne pas abuser du SRP ?</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6382" data-end=3D"6562">
<li data-start=3D"6382" data-end=3D"6494" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6384" data-end=3D"6494" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
384" data-end=3D"6434">Si la s=C3=A9paration complique inutilement le code<=
/strong> (ex. trop de classes pour des responsabilit=C3=A9s triviales).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6495" data-end=3D"6562" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6497" data-end=3D"6562" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
497" data-end=3D"6559">Si le projet est petit et ne justifie pas cette s=C3=
=A9paration</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
