</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"2509" data-end=3D"2534">permettre l=E2=
=80=99extension</strong> en utilisant l=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"2550"=
 data-end=3D"2562">h=C3=A9ritage</strong> et le <strong data-start=3D"2569"=
 data-end=3D"2586">polymorphisme</strong>.</p>
