<h3 data-start=3D"2750" data-end=3D"2808" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2754" data-end=3D"2806">2.2 Pourquoi cette impl=C3=A9mentation viole le LSP=
 ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2809" data-end=3D"3020" class=3D"">=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"2812" data-end=3D"2838">Comportement inattendu</strong> :<br da=
ta-start=3D"2840" data-end=3D"2843">
Dans la classe <code data-start=3D"2858" data-end=3D"2869">Rectangle</code>=
, on s=E2=80=99attend =C3=A0 ce que la largeur et la hauteur <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2917" data-end=3D"2948">puissent =C3=AAtre ind=C3=A9pendantes</stro=
ng>. Mais dans <code data-start=3D"2960" data-end=3D"2967">Carre</code>, ce=
 n'est pas le cas, ce qui fausse les r=C3=A9sultats.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3022" data-end=3D"3233" class=3D"">=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3025" data-end=3D"3046">D=C3=A9pendance cach=C3=A9e</strong> :<=
br data-start=3D"3048" data-end=3D"3051">
Un <code data-start=3D"3054" data-end=3D"3065">Rectangle</code> peut avoir =
une largeur diff=C3=A9rente de la hauteur, mais un <code data-start=3D"3123=
" data-end=3D"3130">Carre</code> force une =C3=A9galit=C3=A9. Si un code s=
=E2=80=99attend =C3=A0 un <code data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3186">Recta=
ngle</code>, il risque de mal fonctionner avec un <code data-start=3D"3225"=
 data-end=3D"3232">Carre</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3235" data-end=3D"3419" class=3D"">=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"3238" data-end=3D"3267">Difficult=C3=A9 de maintenance</strong>=
 :<br data-start=3D"3269" data-end=3D"3272">
Ce genre d=E2=80=99impl=C3=A9mentation oblige =C3=A0 ajouter des conditions=
 sp=C3=A9ciales dans le code pour g=C3=A9rer les <code data-start=3D"3368" =
data-end=3D"3375">Carr=C3=A9</code>, ce qui annule les b=C3=A9n=C3=A9fices =
de l=E2=80=99h=C3=A9ritage.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3421" data-end=3D"3424" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3426" data-end=3D"3480" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3429" data-end=3D"3478">3. Appliquer le Liskov Substitution Principle</stro=
ng></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3482" data-end=3D"3613" class=3D"">Nous devons =C3=A9viter=
 l=E2=80=99h=C3=A9ritage incorrect et pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rer <strong data-start=
=3D"3534" data-end=3D"3552">la composition</strong> ou <strong data-start=
=3D"3556" data-end=3D"3573">une interface</strong> pour =C3=A9viter les com=
portements impr=C3=A9vus.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3615" data-end=3D"3661" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3619" data-end=3D"3659">3.1 Refactoring avec l=E2=80=99OCP et le LSP</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3759" class=3D"">Nous allons cr=C3=A9er =
