<p data-start=3D"87" data-end=3D"319" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99<strong data-sta=
rt=3D"89" data-end=3D"130">Interface Segregation Principle (ISP)</strong> e=
st le quatri=C3=A8me principe du <strong data-start=3D"160" data-end=3D"169=
">SOLID</strong> en programmation orient=C3=A9e objet. Il est souvent n=C3=
=A9glig=C3=A9, mais il joue un r=C3=B4le cl=C3=A9 dans la conception modula=
ire et maintenable des syst=C3=A8mes logiciels.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"321" data-end=3D"348" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"32=
5" data-end=3D"346">D=C3=A9finition du ISP</strong></h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"349" data-end=3D"460">
<p data-start=3D"351" data-end=3D"460" class=3D""><em data-start=3D"351" da=
ta-end=3D"460">Une classe ne doit pas =C3=AAtre forc=C3=A9e d=E2=80=99impl=
=C3=A9menter une interface dont elle n=E2=80=99utilise pas toutes les m=C3=
=A9thodes.</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"462" data-end=3D"638" class=3D"">Ce principe stipule que <=
strong data-start=3D"486" data-end=3D"541">les interfaces doivent =C3=AAtre=
 sp=C3=A9cifiques =C3=A0 un besoin</strong> plut=C3=B4t que trop g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A9riques. Il =C3=A9vite que les classes soient surcharg=C3=A9es de m=C3=
=A9thodes inutilis=C3=A9es.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"640" data-end=3D"643" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"645" data-end=3D"711" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"64=
8" data-end=3D"709">1. Pourquoi appliquer l=E2=80=99Interface Segregation P=
rinciple ?</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"713" data-end=3D"1158" class=3D"">=E2=9C=94 <strong data-s=
tart=3D"715" data-end=3D"745">R=C3=A9duction de la complexit=C3=A9</strong>=
 : Moins de m=C3=A9thodes inutiles signifie <strong data-start=3D"784" data=
-end=3D"806">un code plus clair</strong>.<br data-start=3D"807" data-end=3D=
"810">
=E2=9C=94 <strong data-start=3D"812" data-end=3D"839">Facilit=C3=A9 de main=
tenance</strong> : Moins de d=C3=A9pendances inutiles <strong data-start=3D=
"872" data-end=3D"910">r=C3=A9duisent l=E2=80=99impact des changements</str=
ong>.<br data-start=3D"911" data-end=3D"914">
=E2=9C=94 <strong data-start=3D"916" data-end=3D"939">Meilleur d=C3=A9coupl=
