<h3 data-start=3D"2766" data-end=3D"2812" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2770" data-end=3D"2810">2.3 Pourquoi ce design est mauvais ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2813" data-end=3D"3110" class=3D"">=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"2816" data-end=3D"2837">M=C3=A9thodes inutiles</strong> : Un <s=
trong data-start=3D"2843" data-end=3D"2858">D=C3=A9veloppeur</strong> n=E2=
=80=99a pas besoin de <code data-start=3D"2877" data-end=3D"2895">conduireC=
amion()</code>.<br data-start=3D"2896" data-end=3D"2899">
=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong data-start=3D"2902" data-end=3D"2926">Violation du con=
trat</strong> : L=E2=80=99exception <code data-start=3D"2941" data-end=3D"2=
972">UnsupportedOperationException</code> montre que l=E2=80=99interface es=
t mal con=C3=A7ue.<br data-start=3D"3011" data-end=3D"3014">
=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong data-start=3D"3017" data-end=3D"3041">D=C3=A9pendances=
 inutiles</strong> : Une classe impl=C3=A9mente des m=C3=A9thodes dont <str=
ong data-start=3D"3084" data-end=3D"3107">elle n=E2=80=99a pas besoin</stro=
ng>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3112" data-end=3D"3115" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3117" data-end=3D"3172" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3120" data-end=3D"3170">3. Appliquer l=E2=80=99Interface Segregation Princi=
ple</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"3174" data-end=3D"3251" class=3D"">Nous allons <strong dat=
