<ul data-start=3D"388" data-end=3D"652">
<li data-start=3D"388" data-end=3D"444" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"390" data-end=3D"444" class=3D"">Expliquer la d=C3=A9finit=
ion et les objectifs du <strong data-start=3D"434" data-end=3D"441">DIP</st=
rong>.</p>
