<li data-start=3D"445" data-end=3D"503" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"447" data-end=3D"503" class=3D"">Analyser les probl=C3=A8m=
es li=C3=A9s =C3=A0 la <strong data-start=3D"480" data-end=3D"500">violatio=
n du DIP</strong>.</p>
