<h2 data-start=3D"1339" data-end=3D"1378" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1342" data-end=3D"1376">2. Pourquoi appliquer le DIP ?</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1380" data-end=3D"1435" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1384" data-end=3D"1433">Sans DIP : un couplage fort entre les classes</stro=
ng></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1436" data-end=3D"1649" class=3D"">=E2=9D=8C Changements d=
ans une classe =3D <strong data-start=3D"1468" data-end=3D"1498">modificati=
