lVersion&gt;</code></strong> : La version du mod=C3=A8le POM (toujours <cod=
e data-start=3D"2648" data-end=3D"2655">4.0.0</code> dans la plupart des ca=
s).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2682" data-end=3D"2754" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2684" data-end=3D"2754" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
684" data-end=3D"2699"><code data-start=3D"2686" data-end=3D"2697">&lt;grou=
pId&gt;</code></strong> : L'identifiant unique du groupe ou de l'organisati=
on.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2755" data-end=3D"2845" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2757" data-end=3D"2845" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
757" data-end=3D"2775"><code data-start=3D"2759" data-end=3D"2773">&lt;arti=
factId&gt;</code></strong> : L'identifiant unique de l'artefact (g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A9ralement le nom du projet).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2846" data-end=3D"2891" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2848" data-end=3D"2891" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
