ndencies&gt;</code></strong> : Contient toutes les d=C3=A9pendances du proj=
et. Chaque d=C3=A9pendance doit sp=C3=A9cifier un <code data-start=3D"3072"=
 data-end=3D"3081">groupId</code>, un <code data-start=3D"3086" data-end=3D=
"3098">artifactId</code> et une <code data-start=3D"3106" data-end=3D"3115"=
>version</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3117" data-end=3D"3304" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3119" data-end=3D"3304" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
