<h3 data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3342" class=3D"">1.3. D=C3=A9claration =
des d=C3=A9pendances</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3344" data-end=3D"3493" class=3D"">Les d=C3=A9pendances da=
ns Maven sont sp=C3=A9cifi=C3=A9es =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9rieur de la se=
ction <code data-start=3D"3415" data-end=3D"3431">&lt;dependencies&gt;</cod=
e>. Chaque d=C3=A9pendance est un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment <code data-start=3D"346=
